Z||000011||Seanh||11-04-2000||09:12 AM||||Thats still a pretty risky situation, the cop would probally give you a sitation anyway. It doesnt sound legal to me, but thats me... Honestly, I dont see the harm in doing it, except maybe not being legal. If that gas tank explodes, it is not going to matter where in the car your sitting, your most likly a goner anway. I say just set the kid on the passenger side floor. With the seat back there is alot of foot room there. Iv have 5 people in my Fiero before. Very akward, but we fit. And no, we were't smashed up against the windows like the T.V. ad, except in hard turns.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/seanhsig.gif">   <BR>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto<BR>Going on to 3.4 in Jan.<BR><I>If you smoke after sex, your doing it way to fast.</I>||||reg||1
Z||000012||ThatRickGuy||11-04-2000||10:39 AM||||ya know, the guys down at the shop were asking me if I was gonna chop the trunk and put a bench seat back there, kinda like those old roadsters w/ the flip out seat in back. doubt it'd ever be leagal, but it'd be pretty cool if it could be done.a\ as for the kid on the gas tank... put him in a car seat with a sheet of metal on the bottom, then drive w/ the sun roof off. If for some reason the tank does blow, the kid will just get ejected threw the sun roof  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000013||BAM-BAM||11-04-2000||11:11 AM||||   Cool Rick, Is that the new ACES-4 ejection system? Heck if you put a Targa top on and sheeted the whole floor and added a rollcage, you could be like the F-111 and have the entire pod eject. The family  that rides together, flys together. BTW, do the Fiero gas tanks have a habit of exploding????<P> Have Fun guys, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT<BR>Eibach Springs/KYB shocks and struts<BR>Mr.Mikes 500 series seats, Carpet and headliner! MOMO Commando Steering Wheel, White Face Race Style Guages And Soon To Be More!!! YEAH BABY-YEAH||||reg||12
